SUMMARY:Here Where We Live Is Our Country: An Evening with Molly Crabapple
  - by The United Jewish People’s Order
LOCATION:Isabel Bader Theatre\, 93 Charles St. West
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.zeffy.com/en-CA/ticketing/here-where-we-live-is-our-country-a
 n-evening-with-molly-crabapple\n\nHosted by The United Jewish People’s
  Order
  (https://www.winchevskycentre.org/united-jewish-peoples-order/)\n\nJoin
  for a evening with author Molly Crabapple in conversation with Professor
  Jason Stanley. Authors will be signing books. Evening will open with a
  community-led Shabbos ritual\, as practiced at the Peoples’ Circle for
  Palestine. All proceeds will be donated to Glia\, a medical solidarity
  organization dedicated healthcare in Gaza.
END:VEVENT
