SUMMARY:TfD Film Club: The Sandbox - by Technologists for Democracy
LOCATION:Hot Docs
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://luma.com/hlnxg58r\n\nHosted by Technologists
  for Democracy (https://techfordemocracy.ca/)\n\n​From the Arizona
  desert to refugee camps in Greece\, Mediterranean rescue missions and
  data-labelling centres in Nairobi\, The Sandbox shows how borders have
  become testing grounds for AI\, drones and biometric surveillance\, and
  what that costs the people living under them. Watch the film with TfD at
  Hot Docs and join for drinks after.
END:VEVENT
