SUMMARY:Workers Unite Online Meeting! - by Construction Workers’
  Industrial Organisation
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/Dd2c1jWFPIJ/\n\nHosted
  by Construction Workers’ Industrial Organisation
  (https://www.instagram.com/cwiowuf/)\n\nWorkers organised under the IBEW
  are in bad shape. The union is turning to open collaboration with the
  bourgeoisie as a matter of strategy\, sidelining the voice of workers. 
  Join this webinar to discuss how workers organised under the IBEW can
  retake the control of their union!
END:VEVENT
