SUMMARY:Digital Sovereignty Webinar - by Technologists for Democracy
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://luma.com/37u0zm88\n\nHosted by Technologists
  for Democracy (https://techfordemocracy.ca/)\n\nWith Canada's reliance on
  US tech for its services\, how do Indigenous rights and practices inform
  how we choose what platforms we opt into? How do we build a digital
  ecosystem that we all consent to? \n\n​Join Technologist for Democracy
  for a discussion with Jeff Doctor to speak on Indigenous data sovereignty
END:VEVENT
