SUMMARY:Making Room: Access to Capital for Affordable Housing - by More
  Neighbours Toronto
LOCATION:It's Ok* Studios
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://luma.com/97u9gvvu\n\nHosted by More
  Neighbours Toronto (https://www.moreneighbours.ca/)\n\n​Why does
  affordable housing keep slipping through the cracks\, even when the will
  to save it exists? In this talk\, Krystal breaks down the real barriers
  standing between communities and the buildings they're trying to protect:
  financial capital\, yes\, but also the social capital and trust-building
  that often gets overlooked.
END:VEVENT
