SUMMARY:Naza screening - by Hot Docs
LOCATION:Hot Docs
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://boxoffice.hotdocs.ca/websales/pages/info.aspx?evtinfo=658890%7Ecf
 285ddd-dacb-4f18-89b8-1252c6dcffa6\n\nHosted by Hot Docs
  (https://hotdocs.ca)\n\nThe directors behind Oscar-winning documentary\,
  No Other Land return with a searing film that turns its investigative
  lens to the systems behind Israel’s military campaign in Gaza.
  Clandestinely filmed at night from rooftops in Tel Aviv\, NAZA reveals
  testimony from Israeli military insiders examining how technology and
  intelligence protocols have shaped the war.
